After considering the rival contentions and the evidence on record, the trial Court, by finding that the petitioner was remarried on 09.09.2012 and 2025:KER:72722 during examination admitted that she has been residing with her 2nd husband, as per the Order dated 09.05.2013, partly allowed the petition as under;
"(i) Respondent No.1 is hereby directed to pay an amount of Rs.3000/- to the petitioner with effect from 05.01.2009 till 08.09.2012 per month as maintenance.
(ii) Respondent No.1 is directed to pay an amount of Rs.1,000/- to the child per month as maintenance from 05.01.2009.
